  - screenTitle: Discover this book
    prompt: 
    selectedButton: overview
    showDiscoverButtons: 1
    showHome: 1
    showTurn: 1
    page: 3
    pageHeading: Great ideas deserve great delivery.
    pageBody: 'The Language & Communication Academy gives institutes and organisations
      the communication skills to thrive in today''s workplace, so they can say what
      they mean and mean what they say.


      It is built for the people who speak
      for a school, a company, or a public service.'
    columns: []
    bookLeft: {fileID: 0}
    bookRight: {fileID: 0}
  - screenTitle: Discover this book
    prompt: 
    selectedButton: description
    showDiscoverButtons: 1
    showHome: 1
    showTurn: 1
    page: 4
    pageHeading: From a language people can stand behind.
    pageBody: The words have to last longer than the course. This is how the academy
      builds that.
    columns:
    - heading: The past
      body: Courses were a one-off class. People left with notes, and the words faded
        when the meeting started.
    - heading: How we are making the difference
      body: The academy stays with the team. Practice is short, spoken, and tied
        to the work they do every week.
    - heading: The future
      body: People say what they mean, and the room understands them. The skill stays
        after the course ends.
    bookLeft: {fileID: 0}
    bookRight: {fileID: 0}
  scenarioPage: 7
